  <Strings>k__BackingField:
    <Dict>k__BackingField:
    - "Thi\xEAn D\u01B0\u01A1ng \xB7 Th\u1EE7y"
    - "Nha, c\u1ED1t"
    - "B\u1ED3ng Toa C\u1EF1 Gi\u1EA3i"
    - "V\u1EADt li\u1EC7u, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i luy\u1EC7n ch\u1EBF ph\xE1p
      b\u1EA3o, thao kh\u1ED1ng m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t, linh t\xEDnh th\u1EE9 hai, nh\u01B0ng
      th\xE2n h\xF2a l\xE0 kh\xF4ng."
    - "Th\u1EE7y thu\u1ED9c t\xEDnh v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i
      luy\u1EC7n kh\xED."
    - "\u0110\u1ECBa \xC2m \xB7 Th\u1EE7y"
    - "B\xEC, l\xE2n phi\u1EBFn"
    - "C\u1EF1 M\xE3ng"
    - "Y\xEAu th\xFA da, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i luy\u1EC7n kh\xED, th\xE2n
      h\xF2a m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t, thao kh\u1ED1ng th\u1EE9 hai, nh\u01B0ng t\xEDnh
      b\u1EC1n d\u1EBBo l\xE0 kh\xF4ng."
    - "Y\xEAu th\xFA x\u01B0\u01A1ng, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i luy\u1EC7n
      kh\xED, thao kh\u1ED1ng m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t, linh t\xEDnh th\u1EE9 hai, nh\u01B0ng
      th\xE2n h\xF2a l\xE0 kh\xF4ng."
    - "Linh v\u1EADt"
    - "Y\xEAu th\xFA \u0111\u1EB7c th\xF9 kh\xED quan, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i
      luy\u1EC7n kh\xED, linh t\xEDnh m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t, ki\xEAn c\u1ED1 th\u1EE9
      hai, nh\u01B0ng thao kh\u1ED1ng l\xE0 kh\xF4ng."
    - "Y\xEAu th\xFA l\xE2n gi\xE1p, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i luy\u1EC7n kh\xED,
      th\xE2n h\xF2a m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t, thao kh\u1ED1ng th\u1EE9 hai, nh\u01B0ng
      t\xEDnh b\u1EC1n d\u1EBBo l\xE0 kh\xF4ng."
    - "Y\xEAu th\xFA r\u0103ng, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i luy\u1EC7n kh\xED,
      thao kh\u1ED1ng m\u1EA1nh nh\u1EA5t, linh t\xEDnh th\u1EE9 hai, nh\u01B0ng
      th\xE2n h\xF2a l\xE0 kh\xF4ng."
    - "Thi\xEAn D\u01B0\u01A1ng \xB7 H\u1ED7n Nguy\xEAn"
    - "C\u1EF1 Ng\u1EA1c"
    - "\u1EA8n ch\u1EE9a c\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u1EA1i H\u1ED7n Nguy\xEAn thu\u1ED9c
      t\xEDnh linh l\u1EF1c v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i luy\u1EC7n
      kh\xED."
    - "\u0110\u1ECBa \xC2m \xB7 H\u1ED7n Nguy\xEAn"
    - "Thi\xEAn D\u01B0\u01A1ng \xB7 Kim"
    - "C\u1EF1 Vi\xEAn"
    - "Kim thu\u1ED9c t\xEDnh v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i
      luy\u1EC7n kh\xED."
    - "\u0110\u1ECBa \xC2m \xB7 Kim"
    - "Thi\xEAn D\u01B0\u01A1ng \xB7 Th\u1EA7n Ni\u1EC7m"
    - "D\u1ECB \u0110\u1ED3ng Chu"
    - "T\u0103ng ph\xFAc th\u1EA7n ni\u1EC7m v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng
      t\u1EA1i luy\u1EC7n kh\xED."
    - "\u0110\u1ECBa \xC2m \xB7 Th\u1EA7n Ni\u1EC7m"
    - "\u0110\u1ECBa \xC2m \xB7 Th\u1ED5"
    - "\u0110\u1ECBa H\xE0nh Chu"
    - "Th\u1ED5 thu\u1ED9c t\xEDnh v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i
      luy\u1EC7n kh\xED."
    - "Thi\xEAn D\u01B0\u01A1ng \xB7 Th\u1ED5"
    - "Thi\xEAn D\u01B0\u01A1ng \xB7 M\u1ED9c"
    - "\u0110\u1ED9c H\u1EA1t"
    - "M\u1ED9c thu\u1ED9c t\xEDnh v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i
      luy\u1EC7n kh\xED."
    - "\u0110\u1ECBa \xC2m \xB7 M\u1ED9c"
    - "\u0110\u1ECBa \xC2m \xB7 H\u1ECFa"
    - "L\xF4i H\u1ECFa D\u1ECBch"
    - "H\u1ECFa thu\u1ED9c t\xEDnh v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i
      luy\u1EC7n kh\xED."
    - "Thi\xEAn D\u01B0\u01A1ng \xB7 H\u1ECFa"
    - "Th\xE2m H\u1EA3i Ch\u01B0\u01A1ng Ng\u01B0"
    - "V\u1EADt li\u1EC7u, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 d\xF9ng t\u1EA1i luy\u1EC7n ch\u1EBF ph\xE1p
      b\u1EA3o"
